      "type": "quote",
      "label": "Procrastination as fear of success",
      "readingLevel": "analytical",
      "parentId": "do-the-hard-things-first:t-part1",
      "content": "Procrastination is the fear of success. People procrastinate because they are afraid of the success that they know will result if they move ahead now. Because success is heavy, carries a responsibility with it."
